(7151023, 1096853, 144365, '<td valign="top">This is getting my only ten, but there are some things that bother me. <br/>1 - I can see your legs. <br/>2 - Can''t figure out where the blood came from. <br/>3 - I would''ve shown just slightly more left arm so it''s readily apparent he''s in the hospital. Just to make things more obvious for other voters. <br/>4 - For some reason the title. I know it''s because of his shirt, but it just doesn''t seem to fit.</td>', 'This is getting my only ten, but there are some things that bother me. 1 - I can see your legs. 2 - Can''t figure out where the blood came from. 3 - I would''ve shown just slightly more left arm so it''s readily apparent he''s in the hospital. Just to make things more obvious for other voters. 4 - For some reason the title. I know it''s because of his shirt, but it just doesn''t seem to fit.', '2014-01-02 22:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7151190, 1096848, 173844, '<td valign="top">Good study of sunlight picking out these leaves.  Great title.</td>', 'Good study of sunlight picking out these leaves.  Great title.', '2014-01-03 09:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
