(7151209, 1096660, 173844, '<td valign="top">Better than in person.  The scratchy shadows are a revelation and the colors perfectly set off the gray tones.</td>', 'Better than in person.  The scratchy shadows are a revelation and the colors perfectly set off the gray tones.', '2014-01-03 10:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
