(7151310, 1094494, 173844, '<td valign="top">So close you can feel his body heat.  Plenty of detail to examine.</td>', 'So close you can feel his body heat.  Plenty of detail to examine.', '2014-01-03 13:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7151312, 1096453, 173844, '<td valign="top">Great trust in those eyes.  This portrait could be improved with more focus on the nose area.</td>', 'Great trust in those eyes.  This portrait could be improved with more focus on the nose area.', '2014-01-03 13:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7151313, 1095990, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice peek at the tops of these buildings, which have come into their own for the holiday season.</td>', 'Nice peek at the tops of these buildings, which have come into their own for the holiday season.', '2014-01-03 13:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7151316, 1096749, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture of the trees and the orange glow on the horizon.  The smoke on the ground snaps one back to the moment.</td>', 'Lovely picture of the trees and the orange glow on the horizon.  The smoke on the ground snaps one back to the moment.', '2014-01-03 13:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7151317, 1096845, 173844, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful image documenting the spread (or decline) of sunlight throughout a seascape.</td>', 'Really beautiful image documenting the spread (or decline) of sunlight throughout a seascape.', '2014-01-03 13:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7151318, 1096762, 173844, '<td valign="top">Loving portrayal of the desire to continue to share the holidays with those who are gone but not forgotten.</td>', 'Loving portrayal of the desire to continue to share the holidays with those who are gone but not forgotten.', '2014-01-03 13:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7151323, 1096719, 49954, '<td valign="top">Would be higher for me if the subject were more lit and the contrail was gone.</td>', 'Would be higher for me if the subject were more lit and the contrail was gone.', '2014-01-03 13:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7151326, 1094753, 49954, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but a little more of her shoulders would improve... also the landscape orientation is a distraction.  Not a technical thing, but it still hurts the photo is the stud in her lower lip... while I hate them as a general rule, it''s a person thing for your model, but in this case, it looks like a fleck of something or food on her chin... IOW it''s not distinctive enough as an adornment... something that would have been helped with a portrait oriented tighter crop.</td>', 'Nice photo, but a little more of her shoulders would improve... also the landscape orientation is a distraction.  Not a technical thing, but it still hurts the photo is the stud in her lower lip... while I hate them as a general rule, it''s a person thing for your model, but in this case, it looks like a fleck of something or food on her chin... IOW it''s not distinctive enough as an adornment... something that would have been helped with a portrait oriented tighter crop.', '2014-01-03 14:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7151328, 1095441, 49954, '<td valign="top">A little more light on those rocks would make all the difference here...</td>', 'A little more light on those rocks would make all the difference here...', '2014-01-03 14:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7151329, 1096824, 49954, '<td valign="top">As opposed to an OLD Joey? :)</td>', 'As opposed to an OLD Joey? :)', '2014-01-03 14:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7151330, 1094494, 49954, '<td valign="top">Border hurts this one...</td>', 'Border hurts this one...', '2014-01-03 14:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7151331, 1096749, 49954, '<td valign="top">... the fire still burns...</td>', '... the fire still burns...', '2014-01-03 14:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7151332, 1096741, 49954, '<td valign="top">Shame she''s not closer...</td>', 'Shame she''s not closer...', '2014-01-03 14:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7151333, 1096853, 49954, '<td valign="top">You''re getting about 30,000,000 comments on this I bet... so poignant... such a moment in time... Photographically, a difficult shot with the overhead angle and more of a journalistic feel.  Without context we can only imagine what is going on for this guy.  I would almost (just almost) think staged shot... except for the telltale bracelet on his arm... so this is real and it breaks my heart even more.  Just took a moment to pray for this child, for their healing and the comfort of their family in this situation.<br/> <br/>I truly hope this ribbons.  I don''t give 10s lightly and I will for this photo.  Not just for sentiment, but for the courage to share this.  Thank you.</td>', 'You''re getting about 30,000,000 comments on this I bet... so poignant... such a moment in time... Photographically, a difficult shot with the overhead angle and more of a journalistic feel.  Without context we can only imagine what is going on for this guy.  I would almost (just almost) think staged shot... except for the telltale bracelet on his arm... so this is real and it breaks my heart even more.  Just took a moment to pray for this child, for their healing and the comfort of their family in this situation. I truly hope this ribbons.  I don''t give 10s lightly and I will for this photo.  Not just for sentiment, but for the courage to share this.  Thank you.', '2014-01-03 14:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7151373, 1096831, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot and very nice perspective.</td>', 'Very nice shot and very nice perspective.', '2014-01-03 16:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
