(7154288, 1096734, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> There''s a blob at the top that looks like it could be a spot of dirt on your camera''s sensor. Or it could just be an odd cloud. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ah yes there does appear to be some dirt on the sensor. I was in Ireland with only access to the internet via my phone so I just entered the only photo I had in my workshop that was applicable. Unfortunately I failed to spot this blob of dirt. Don''t think it made a huge difference to the score anyway but thanks for the heads up:)</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: There''s a blob at the top that looks like it could be a spot of dirt on your camera''s sensor. Or it could just be an odd cloud.   Ah yes there does appear to be some dirt on the sensor. I was in Ireland with only access to the internet via my phone so I just entered the only photo I had in my workshop that was applicable. Unfortunately I failed to spot this blob of dirt. Don''t think it made a huge difference to the score anyway but thanks for the heads up:)', '2014-01-08 06:04:13.000000', NULL, 0),
