(7154413, 1096609, 83845, '<td valign="top">I''m sure it will, Chris, but in my defense, I asked SC to pull it when I realized what I did.  They didn''t get the request on time and now that it ribboned, it''s going to be a public DQ.  First time I sat up until midnight praying for my score to go DOWN, LOL!</td>', 'I''m sure it will, Chris, but in my defense, I asked SC to pull it when I realized what I did.  They didn''t get the request on time and now that it ribboned, it''s going to be a public DQ.  First time I sat up until midnight praying for my score to go DOWN, LOL!', '2014-01-08 11:45:15.000000', NULL, 0),
