(7154426, 1096609, 83845, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Venser:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by cynthiann:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m sure it will, Chris, but in my defense, I asked SC to pull it when I realized what I did.  They didn''t get the request on time and now that it ribboned, it''s going to be a public DQ.  First time I sat up until midnight praying for my score to go DOWN, LOL! </i></td></tr></table>I can''t reply to PMs (banned for a very long time), but it was easy to spot since they''re side by side on your profile. <br/> <br/>You don''t have to defend yourself. Even after the DQ you can still rejoice that you did beat all but two in the FS. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hard to rejoice while anticipating a public lynching, lol.  Why did this have to ribbon!!  It wasn''t intentional, just me being a dumbass.  Again, I requested that it be removed before voting was over...</td>', 'Originally posted by Venser: Originally posted by cynthiann: I''m sure it will, Chris, but in my defense, I asked SC to pull it when I realized what I did.  They didn''t get the request on time and now that it ribboned, it''s going to be a public DQ.  First time I sat up until midnight praying for my score to go DOWN, LOL! I can''t reply to PMs (banned for a very long time), but it was easy to spot since they''re side by side on your profile.  You don''t have to defend yourself. Even after the DQ you can still rejoice that you did beat all but two in the FS.   Hard to rejoice while anticipating a public lynching, lol.  Why did this have to ribbon!!  It wasn''t intentional, just me being a dumbass.  Again, I requested that it be removed before voting was over...', '2014-01-08 12:07:05.000000', NULL, 0);
